      "questionId": "qe-c09-0136",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s05-p101-01335-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Again, one more loss and Houston’s season would have been over.",
      "sentenceSha256": "0b5fc39a5e292af029ebcdb220d90c0bbb64e7c648139784a36592b65e98879a",
