        101
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0140",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s05-p101-03480-s003",
      "sentenceText": "But it wasn’t.",
      "sentenceSha256": "8536dd64f36f70682d6a39c412830ab034dc0d87119d6fe9f3f29fb9b74e8337",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s05-p101-03480-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-076",
      "parentFingerprint": "9970d21e0ac2e1a1d5cb15523db86d0e6efd2dbf24fe6b21a305795b8d9343bc",
      "passageSha256": "bf4d133fe5b036e6f395e2534c1ed656ea3a26d965b43b8b2838374ce8a740cc",
      "pdfPages": [
        101
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0141",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s05-p101-03480-s004",
      "sentenceText": "Head coach Rudy Tomjanovich famously proclaimed, “Don’t ever underestimate the heart of a champion!”",
      "sentenceSha256": "31792932e660ed631a6e5e2fc8e25e4a3cdc0ebecf07b8ab22580e31ec7c025d",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s05-p101-03480-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-076",
      "parentFingerprint": "9970d21e0ac2e1a1d5cb15523db86d0e6efd2dbf24fe6b21a305795b8d9343bc",
      "passageSha256": "bf4d133fe5b036e6f395e2534c1ed656ea3a26d965b43b8b2838374ce8a740cc",
      "pdfPages": [
        101
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0142",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s05-p101-03480-s005",
      "sentenceText": "The 1995 playoffs were moving, dramatic, and a whole lot psychologically richer than watching a number one seed win the championship.",
      "sentenceSha256": "538e72ad8a166108bd87d78549e35efc6f21bbc22b02916259edcc917347d188",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s05-p101-03480-r005-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-077",
      "parentFingerprint": "535d635b2d2ed8aef22a19f3e6e2828d71221007f891ba47d7eed37268e3740e",
      "passageSha256": "e8381aa8ca533de5ca8a1e3496258cb734a3fb8c91ba837f64ec2b0f86928afc",
      "pdfPages": [
        101
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0143",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s06-p101-05745-s001",
      "sentenceText": "So, yes, reading a poem or novel, watching a film, looking at a piece of artwork, or watching an awe-inspiring athletic performance increases psychological richness.",
      "sentenceSha256": "2a0ba538118e11c1020e837bed6ed8f87c4155f97cca873e3d1eddfeb0aba76f",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s06-p101-05745-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-078",
      "parentFingerprint": "fc78001c614cf0e3b5b24ae116da17a752b944a304b27f534300915b2548fc8a",
      "passageSha256": "69dd5318f3f556eac2ea52eeaa0ef00c90b1ae8d19a1f7737793318b8331fbb4",
      "pdfPages": [
        101,
        102
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0144",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s06-p101-05745-s003",
      "sentenceText": "In this sense, it differs from firsthand experiences gained through personal adventures.",
      "sentenceSha256": "74e38b55b6facb75890faa5bdb32eef3495c2b86897680c73ed5a08753116028",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s06-p101-05745-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-078",
      "parentFingerprint": "fc78001c614cf0e3b5b24ae116da17a752b944a304b27f534300915b2548fc8a",
      "passageSha256": "69dd5318f3f556eac2ea52eeaa0ef00c90b1ae8d19a1f7737793318b8331fbb4",
      "pdfPages": [
        101,
        102
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0145",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s06-p102-01140-s003",
      "sentenceText": "In his real life, Proust was often sick and refrained from traveling too far.",
      "sentenceSha256": "b24215afc898b329a4b07996832fbecebf70ced57f8fc45a5a0505b506dd4dad",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s06-p102-01140-r002-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-080",
      "parentFingerprint": "19073a7bdb9cfb0fe3576fa785b714221dc050473b10d9c47a083c7c38629972",
      "passageSha256": "7fc4b642cbacce1d4de7dd6178ffdda9b6f22a2d46b40d1135c00129ae5699ca",
      "pdfPages": [
        102
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0146",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s06-p102-03675-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Film critic Roger Ebert watched over 10,000 movies and wrote over 6,000 reviews.",
      "sentenceSha256": "685bd06047a7fdd26c0a3b0027fad20b4d67f77f7b43a72516963faa277c19c6",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s06-p102-03675-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-082",
      "parentFingerprint": "9274916bc9dcffc0c2e8cbf028bdebd8b5be56ebb5a4748d7f6634d64b72b95d",
      "passageSha256": "0481736e6b77925e5e7f5fec830d22e3f5436bf8a92880eb82a4114111301159",
      "pdfPages": [
        102
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0147",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s06-p102-03675-s002",
      "sentenceText": "He forgot about most of the films eventually, but he remembered those he deemed worth remembering.",
      "sentenceSha256": "721add99a7ed31d22e67c5f91070b410539a67110ed9a6fc3effdc633aee83ee",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s06-p102-03675-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-082",
      "parentFingerprint": "9274916bc9dcffc0c2e8cbf028bdebd8b5be56ebb5a4748d7f6634d64b72b95d",
      "passageSha256": "0481736e6b77925e5e7f5fec830d22e3f5436bf8a92880eb82a4114111301159",
      "pdfPages": [
        102
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0148",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s06-p102-03675-s005",
      "sentenceText": "That’s why we go, hoping to be touched in those secret places.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "1671cac94d9e474432f2068b29d6e140eb91b944e21322a051c01410f89d1338",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s06-p102-03675-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-083",
      "parentFingerprint": "286c472cec75ec46a2dbc188212619ec08ed289eb3bb9c29bc0e31610f81b52b",
      "passageSha256": "58dd6b7a84bd2e8d89d66dd0714c2eeebe8852a3e74ba13a6371acd46f6a73bf",
      "pdfPages": [
        102
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0149",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s06-p102-03675-s006",
      "sentenceText": "The more you are touched in those secret places, the more psychologically rich your inner life becomes.",
      "sentenceSha256": "7986ac7a16ec91da065a9e5855bdcb6313f4249498cd47dac3558df0e34a3d94",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s06-p102-03675-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-083",
      "parentFingerprint": "286c472cec75ec46a2dbc188212619ec08ed289eb3bb9c29bc0e31610f81b52b",
      "passageSha256": "58dd6b7a84bd2e8d89d66dd0714c2eeebe8852a3e74ba13a6371acd46f6a73bf",
      "pdfPages": [
        102
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0150",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s06-p102-05820-s001",
      "sentenceText": "When we are absorbed in a complex narrative world or the unscripted world of sports, we are transported and transformed.",
      "sentenceSha256": "98cfdbddde2b0a74c200169d96369d42def75c396f00472fdd94a9b41e971268",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s06-p102-05820-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-084",
      "parentFingerprint": "51659e4a98e7ebf7758a016b620867ce3b5d4fbb9349bc35b39f2d1737a0e85c",
      "passageSha256": "98f2976d7ddbb270ad396fe71dd770d26c8cedee4e4a621ef31d352139998be4",
      "pdfPages": [
        102
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0151",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s06-p102-05820-s003",
      "sentenceText": "In short, a psychologically rich experience.",
      "sentenceSha256": "ceaf0cc274f727bedd0b23e5ade54c655b31606cbbeb5701d70ddba3f21549d8",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s06-p102-05820-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-084",
      "parentFingerprint": "51659e4a98e7ebf7758a016b620867ce3b5d4fbb9349bc35b39f2d1737a0e85c",
      "passageSha256": "98f2976d7ddbb270ad396fe71dd770d26c8cedee4e4a621ef31d352139998be4",
      "pdfPages": [
        102
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0001",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s01-p103-03848-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Schindler’s List will make you cry and cry.",
      "sentenceSha256": "f3c0334c747cb92176d66f0e88dad8a20208ce40e81547c620406ca0235d334c",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s01-p103-03848-r001-004",
